Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:23.36,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}この細胞が望む侭
Dialogue: 2,0:06:22.36,0:06:24.78,Insert - JP,,0,0,60,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(lose yourself)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:27.81,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}抉る、恍惚が欲しいから
