Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:38.40,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}意味の無いものだから
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.38,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}(バラバラバラバラ)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.71,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}狂ってるのが普通
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:43.38,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}だから夢中になる
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.37,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}TRUE過ぎな気づき
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:47.67,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}傷口がズキズキ痛むのが
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:49.91,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}生きている印
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:53.10,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}マジで生き辛くって仕様が無い
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:56.09,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}この世界はしょーもない
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:07:00.59,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}いつだって虚構の未来に馬鹿が群がってる
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:03.70,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}だから箍を外してみるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:06.75,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}ワガママに歩くよ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:11.70,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}絶望をギュギュッと抱きしめて
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:35.12,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Now I’m runnin' the crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:36.57,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Baby, gimme my crown
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.57,0:07:38.26,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Skin deep, tough like brown
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.26,0:07:39.77,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}we rise, never drown
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:43.12,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}朝なんて来ないギラギラ{\fscx50} {\fscx100}GALs TOKYO
