Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:49.33,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Yeah, life moving at a stunning pace
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:52.83,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I ain't got no time to be dozin' off in this messed up Space
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:55.12,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I’m out here again today, still playin'
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:58.76,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}this life-or-death game with others and myself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.69,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Kawaii’s the baddest, you know that’s true
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:04.81,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Ain’t nobody flexin’ like us, it’s just our crew
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:07.94,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Showin’ your heart? Nah, that’s what fools do
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.94,0:08:11.09,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}But with my homies, I ride, we stick like glue
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:13.01,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}It's a vibe ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:14.37,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}そ、ハスラーの笑み
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:18.10,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}くっせーおぢの苦しみどーでもいい
