Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:40.93,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}どうか救われたい
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.93,0:16:42.36,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}誰でもいいわ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:46.69,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}このアタシの手を取ってくれよ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.51,0:16:51.95,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}溶けていく熱情　鮮やかに
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.97,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(LA LA LA LA LA LA LA LA)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:58.40,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}瞬く閃光へすっと消えていく
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:00.17,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(LA LA LA LA LA LA LA LA)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:01.74,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}綺麗なままで
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:03.44,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}狂ったままで
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:06.74,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}愛に満ちた絶望の中で
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:09.80,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}You&Me　4{\fscx50} {\fscx100}に絶えるのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.19,0:20:01.03,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Rusted shadows on the city
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.03,0:20:07.08,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I keep biting down on all these broken fading dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:10.11,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Mocking voices, cold eyes, just noise
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.11,0:20:15.72,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Kicking around, break it out, spread the wings{\fscx50\fsp1} {\fscx100}どこまでも遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:19.66,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Break the burning door, crash it into endless dust
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:24.49,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Glaring eyes behold the shattered future’s remains
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:28.20,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}囁いた影を切り裂いて
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:32.71,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}燃える鼓動で答えよう
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:42.97,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}叫んで掻き消して　偽りも迷いも全て
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:51.80,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}痛みを刃に　生きた証を刻め
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:56.57,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}Break the chain, Run through the night
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.57,0:21:00.74,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}壊れそうな世界でも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:05.20,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}Call my name, Reach for the light
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:10.10,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}抗い続けろ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:13.29,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Buried deep in the cage of memories
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:19.18,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Gathering the broken scars oncecrushed beneath my feet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.18,0:21:22.68,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Sparks that light and shine through the darkness  around me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:27.89,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Never close your eyes to the weakness deep inside your soul
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.89,0:21:31.86,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}走り出せ限界を越えて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:35.98,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}新しい夜明けへと
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:55.83,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}解き放て衝動を　過去も未来も蹴散らして
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:22:04.62,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}痛みを光に　暗闇を塗りつぶせ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:09.45,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Break the chain, Run through the night
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.45,0:22:13.53,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}この瞬間をねじ伏せろ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.53,0:22:17.86,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Call my name, Reach for the light
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.86,0:22:22.46,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2}孤独を背負って
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.41,0:28:42.59,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}You left behind a clue, then disappeared
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.54,0:28:50.71,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Dreams and hopes for the world endeared
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.08,0:28:58.34,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Your smile is fleeting foam
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.34,0:29:01.36,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}In memories too beautiful to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.36,0:29:06.68,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}You' ve waited here so long
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.68,0:29:09.10,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Longing for it to end
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.78,0:29:19.09,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}In a storm of bullets, brave yet forlorn
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.54,0:29:27.50,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Bound in shackles, where you belong?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.45,0:29:33.95,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}To let you stay as you truly are
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.95,0:29:37.43,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I' ll sever the light
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.43,0:29:44.17,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}To become myself, to break the chain
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.17,0:29:46.64,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}This blade will end it
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.65,0:30:23.43,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}You were my light so bright I couldn' t look you in the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.15,0:30:30.77,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Still I kept on chasing believing you' d be right here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.77,0:30:34.72,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}I learned to love this world
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.72,0:30:38.50,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}cause you still spark a flame in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.50,0:30:42.23,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}May this place you shine upon
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.23,0:30:46.12,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}never be the one to bring you pain
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.12,0:30:49.70,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}This heart grew day by day
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.70,0:30:53.62,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}because your smile has always carried me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.62,0:30:55.60,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}In my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.60,0:30:57.35,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}You' re my light
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.35,0:31:01.83,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Still my light
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.30,0:31:17.73,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(You' re my light)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.73,0:31:19.57,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Inside of me, in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.57,0:31:23.87,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}you'll live and breathe forever a guiding star that shines on
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.87,0:31:25.15,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}(It' s all right)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.15,0:31:29.28,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}Somewhere out there in this world beyond the bounds of space
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.28,0:31:31.41,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}you' ll stay our savior
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.41,0:31:35.12,Insert - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fax-0.2\fsp0}You' re my light
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.85,0:34:07.44,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}こんな{\fscx50} {\fscx100}Dream dream days　ウキウキするのになんで？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.44,0:34:08.28,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}Looking for you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.28,0:34:10.40,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}君はつれない　そっけない
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.86,0:34:12.03,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}Feeling{\fscx50} {\fscx100}って
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.03,0:34:14.78,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}大事なんだから　こっちむいて
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.78,0:34:15.83,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}Look at me
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.83,0:34:17.29,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}ドラマ　ティンク　ティンク
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.29,0:34:18.16,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.16,0:34:21.21,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}Hey Mr. DJ Come on 止めないで
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.21,0:34:24.67,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}ワクワク Like a starlight 光らせて
