Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.39,0:34:40.43,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}好きって言わせたいな{\fscx50} {\fscx100}One more time
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.43,0:34:44.27,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}宇宙へ{\fscx50} {\fscx100}Super shot　外せないでしょ
