Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.53,0:35:39.74,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}好きって言わせたいな{\fscx50} {\fscx100}One more time
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.74,0:35:43.75,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}運命の{\fscx50} {\fscx100}Super shot　外せないでしょ
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.75,0:35:47.83,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur7}届けストレートに光るよ　キラリ
